Package: finalproject
Title: BST260 Final Project
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yitian(Ethan)",
           family = "Chen",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ethanchen@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: A proposal for an individual BST260 final project. The planned
    analyses concern BMI and blood pressure in NHANES and foodborne and
    waterborne outbreak sizes in CDC data. Includes the course datasets
    and a pkgdown website.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
